{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867292071793262602","content":"Gaillardia studies the visages of the two ravens. \"Were this deal with anyone else it would be fair, no? But you wish to bargain because her years are also yours in a way...\" she pauses to think while sipping her tea.","created_at":"2021-07-21T08:37:44.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867324455512834068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"867292071793262602","content":"\"We do not lightly tread upon the lands of color. It would be disrespectful not to engage in your custom while in your lands.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T08:39:04.813000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867324793195462676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867292071793262602","content":"She cocks her head, before nodding to herself slowly. \"I do not wish to relinquish full control, but i am willing to allow you to choose your part of my next deal. Though i would stipulate it be of memory or thought. To offer you something not of yours would be inappropriate as well, no?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T08:42:22.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867325623240491018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"867292071793262602","content":"\"Our Tenants are Three. Thought, Memory, or a Life. You are owed one visitation to the Noir as payment for our trespass upon your land. No debt will go unpaid.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T08:45:29.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867326407939194880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867292071793262602","content":"She nods. \"That is quite acceptable.\" She smiles and extends a hand, before putting it down and chuckling. \"The deal I made stands. You will have the agreed upon piece of my next deal, and i am owed a visitation to the land of shadow and no color. The deal I made stands. You will have the agreed upon piece of my next deal, and i am owed a visitation to the land of shadow and no color. The deal I made stands. You will have the agreed upon piece of my next deal, and i am owed a visitation to the land of shadow and no color. Thus it is agreed upon thrice.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T08:49:31.056000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867327419849637888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"867292071793262602","content":"\"Thrice you have asked. Thrice we have answered. The asking, and the answering of three questions are complete\"\n\n\"The payment of intermixing color with shade is acceptable.\"\n\n\"May our kingdoms long profit from today's union.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T08:51:11.487000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867327841087389766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
